<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  Your contracting position "<%= @position.title %>" for <%= @event.name %> has ended>.
</p>

<p>
  If you have any outstanding work to bill for, you can still submit one final invoice
  for this position until <%= @position.final_invoice_deadline.to_fs(:long) %>.
  After that, you will no longer be able to submit invoices for this position.
</p>

<% if @position.invoices.submitted.exists? || @position.payments.pending_or_under_review.any? %>
  <p>Any pending invoices or payments for this position will still be reviewed and processed as usual.</p>
<% end %>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Submit a final invoice", my_pay_url(legal_entity_id: @payee.legal_entity_id) %>
</p>

<p>
  If you have any questions, please contact <%= @event.name %>.
</p>

<p>
  Sincerely,
  <br><br>
  The HCB Team
</p>

<p><i class="muted"><%= @event.name %> is fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation (d.b.a. HCB), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit (EIN: 81-2908499).</i></p>
